   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0410_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>PWN pṭmʾn Y hcpl npšṭˈ PWN gwsp̄nd
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>$X-IIII NKSYʾ S-II lwcyk ḤG G-IIII-IIII
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>PWN phlsṭˈ Y G-I K -#III PWN ẔWẔN I whʾk S-I ẔWẔN II
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>ʿL dynʾp̄zwṭˈ Y PWN nmywl dʾlyk ʾp̄sp̄ʾlṭˈ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>W PWN bwnˈ Y dynʾp̄zwṭˈ npšṭˈ W ʾmʾl pṭ-š
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>krṭˈ MḤŠYʾ-IIII dwlkˈ whʾk S-I ẔWẔN II ○
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>KḤDH S-III-II ○ ʿL bʾlkʾn Y PWN nmywl dʾlyk
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>ʾp̄sp̄ʾlṭˈ W PWN bwnˈ Y bʾlkʾn npšṭnˈ W ʾmʾl pṭ-š
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>krṭnˈ ʾp̄ʾdšnˈ pšm X-II mnˈ ○ mwd-III W PRG
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>mnˈ ○ MN dynpylwc ʾp̄ẕwn BʿYḤWNsṭˈ ʾs&lt;p̄&gt;-dwnbkˈ
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>IIII ○ mnˈ ʾmʾlhdybʾl M-II ○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0410_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>pad paymān ī azabar nibišt ud pad gōspand
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>34 xwāstag satēr 2 rōzīg gandum grīw 8
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>pad pahrist ī grīw 1 kabīz 3 pad drahm 1 wahāg satēr 1 drahm 2
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ō Dēnabzūd ī pad Namēwar dārīg abespārd
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>ud pad bun ī Dēnabzūd nibišt ud āmār pad-iš
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>kard rōγn 4 dōlag wahāg satēr 1 drahm 2 ○
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>hā̆mist satēr 5 ○ ō Bāragān ī pad Namēwar dārīg
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>abespārd ud pad bun ī Bāragān nibištan ud āmār pad-iš
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>kardan abāyišn pašm 12 man ○ mōy 3 ud nēm
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>man ○ az Dēnpērōz abzōn xwāst *as&lt;p&gt;-dumbag
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>4 ○ man āmārayār dāng 2 ○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0410_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>[1] According to the contract as written above for cattle
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>34 cash 2 staters, ration of 8 grīw of wheat
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>in stock per 1 grīw (and) 3 kabīz for 1 drahm worth 1 stater (and) 2 drahms
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>consigned to Dēnabzūd, manager of Namēwar,
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>and for the bun of Dēnabzūd made a tax calculation over it
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>and 4 dōlag of oil worth 1 stater (and) 2 drahms,
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>altogether (worth) 5 staters. For Bāragān, manager on Namēwar,
               <lb n="8-9" xml:id="trans-p1-l8-9"/>consigned, and for the bun of Bāragān it is necessary to make a tax calculation over it: 12 man of wool, hair(s) 3 and a half
               <lb n="10-11" xml:id="trans-p1-l10-11"/>man. On behalf of Dēnpērōz he wanted in addition 4 man of (hair) of horses’ tails. The tax consultant 2 dāng.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>